{"path":"ranges/drop_while_view/pred","title":"std::ranges::drop_while_view<V,Pred>::pred","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::drop_while_view&lt;V,Pred&gt;::</span>pred","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/drop_while_view/pred","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a reference to the stored predicate.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Pred<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> pred<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a reference to the stored predicate.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> does not store a predicate (e.g. an exception is thrown on the assignment to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, which copy-constructs or move-constructs a <code>Pred</code>), the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A reference to the stored predicate <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/drop_while_view#Data_members\"><code><i>pred_</i></code></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;array&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a> data<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> view <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/drop_while_view\"><span class=\"kw2947\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">drop_while_view</span></span></a>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        data, <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> x <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> data<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"predicate(\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")&nbsp;: \"</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> view.<span class=\"me1\">pred</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>predicate( 0)&nbsp;: true\npredicate(-1)&nbsp;: true\npredicate(-2)&nbsp;: true\npredicate( 3)&nbsp;: false\npredicate( 1)&nbsp;: false\npredicate( 4)&nbsp;: false\npredicate( 1)&nbsp;: false\npredicate( 5)&nbsp;: false</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/drop_while_view","title":"std::ranges::views::drop_while, std::ranges::drop_while_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::drop_while_view<V,Pred>::pred","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Returns a reference to the stored predicate."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A reference to the stored predicate pred_."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":144,"codeBlockCount":2}
